  <name>Deployd</name>
  <summary>Linux-native mod manager for Bethesda and REDEngine games</summary>

  <developer id="io.github.mattianelo">
    <name>Mattianelo</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Deployd is a Linux-native mod manager for Bethesda and REDEngine games,
      built with GTK4 and libadwaita. It integrates with Steam and Heroic Launcher,
      handles Nexus Mods downloads via SSO login and NXM links, and deploys mods
      as hardlinks for safe, non-destructive mod management.
    </p>
    <p>Currently in public beta (v0.9.3).</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Supports Skyrim SE, Fallout 4, Fallout: New Vegas, Starfield, The Witcher 3, and Cyberpunk 2077</li>
      <li>Game detection from Steam and Heroic Launcher (GOG/Epic)</li>
      <li>Nexus Mods SSO login and NXM deep-link support</li>
      <li>Install mods from ZIP, 7z, and RAR archives</li>
      <li>FOMOD installer wizard with conditional steps and visibility rules</li>
      <li>Drag-and-drop mod and plugin load order</li>
      <li>Profile system for switching between mod configurations</li>
      <li>Conflict detection with per-file detail</li>
      <li>Non-destructive deployment via hardlinks</li>
      <li>External tool launcher with Wine/Proton support</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

