        button to each mod row.</p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.9.1" date="2026-03-08" type="development">
      <description>
        <p>Adds SSO login for Nexus Mods, Steam library detection, and promotes REDEngine
        support (The Witcher 3, Cyberpunk 2077) to stable. Adds Fallout: New Vegas and
        Starfield support.</p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.9.0" date="2025-03-03" type="development">
      <description>
        <p>First public beta. Includes Nexus Mods integration, FOMOD installer wizard,
        profile system, drag-and-drop load order, and REDEngine game support.</p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.1.0" date="2025-02-10" type="development">
